    <item>
      <title>Oriel v1.2.0</title>
      <link>https://github.com/domus-apps/oriel/releases/tag/v1.2.0</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 13:21:28 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li>A Center action (⌃⌥C by default) that centers the focused window on its display, customizable like every other shortcut.</li>
<li>First-run onboarding that explains the app and hosts the Accessibility permission ask — the launch-time system prompt is gone.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>The status menu shows the app version at the top.</li>
</ul>      ]]></description>
